# This file being here turns TRAINING MODE on.
#
# While it exists, agents load .agents/rules/training-mode.md and teach the system as
# they use it: explain before executing, define every term on first use, answer every
# question with the reasoning behind it, and never invent a command.
#
# Turn it off whenever you feel ready:   /training off
# Turn it back on any time:              /training on
# Deleting this file by hand does exactly the same thing.
#
# Nothing is gated behind training mode. What is left when it goes is the real system,
# not a reduced one.
